      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks!\nUnfortunately while I was looking at implementation of the server-side, I remembered that we typically offset those values by +1 (see http://shortn/_42aU6MogbX) to make space for the case where no value at all has been set by the client.\nSo 0x7FFFFFFF +1 would also fall outside of the protobuf range. So i32::MAX - 1 would be preferred.\nSorry for the back and forth, I should have thought about that earlier.",
